<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates close steady, seen stable.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates close steady, seen stable.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed steady on Monday on low exports at the close of the 1996/97 (July-June) buget, dealers said. Rates were likely to remain stable this week, they added.</p>
<p>Rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>		     Monday	June 16</p>
<p>    Globe (Hina brand)	 460	   460</p>
<p>    Shafiq (Gold Key brand)  410	   410</p>
<p>    MGM			    450	   450</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
